  "description": "<p data-start=\"309\" data-end=\"694\">This <strong data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"349\">rectangle handwoven rattan tray</strong> is beautifully crafted by Vietnamese artisans using sustainably harvested natural rattan. With its clean edges, tightly woven structure, and natural finish, the tray is both stylish and practical — perfect for <strong data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"587\">serving food and drinks</strong>, <strong data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"623\">organizing tabletop essentials</strong>, or as a <strong data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"653\">decorative piece</strong> in cafes, hotels, and eco-living spaces.</p>\n<p data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"898\">Each tray reflects traditional craftsmanship passed down through generations in rural Vietnam. Lightweight yet sturdy, the tray is ideal for <strong data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"897\">hospitality use, homeware retail, or gifting collections</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"1045\">We offer full <strong data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"933\">OEM/ODM support</strong> — including custom sizes, shapes, colors, and logo stamping — tailored for wholesale and international markets.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1047\" data-end=\"1050\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1074\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1074\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1442\">\n<li data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1118\">\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1118\">100% handwoven from <strong data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1116\">natural rattan</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1172\">\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1172\">Rectangle shape with reinforced sides and handles</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1219\">\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1219\"><strong data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1191\">Eco-friendly</strong>, durable, and lightweight</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1268\">\n<p data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1268\">Ideal for serving, organizing, or decorating</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1269\" data-end=\"1338\">\n<p data-start=\"1271\" data-end=\"1338\">Suitable for <strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1336\">cafes, hotels, kitchens, spas, and retail stores</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1402\">\n<p data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1402\"><strong data-start=\"1341\" data-end=\"1357\">Customizable</strong> (size/logo/finish) for OEM and bulk orders</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1442\">\n<p data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1442\">Handmade by rural artisans in Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1444\" data-end=\"1447\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1483\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1481\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1650\">Interested in bulk buying or developing your private label?<br data-start=\"1543\" data-end=\"1546\" />👉 Please contact us for a catalog and quote:<br data-start=\"1591\" data-end=\"1594\" /><strong data-start=\"1594\" data-end=\"1624\">📧 <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1622\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong><br data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1627\" /><strong data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1650\">🌐 <a class=\"\" href=\"http://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1648\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></strong></p>",
